# GitHub Link In Every Message

When working on tracked GitHub work in the current session, include a clickable Markdown link in every assistant message.

- If an active PR exists, include the PR link.
- Required formats:
  - `PR: [#<number>](https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/pull/<number>)`
- If multiple PRs exist, include the most recently opened active PR.
- Keep the link present in short status updates and acknowledgements.
